--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,460] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 不要让任何人了解你
Segment #2   [00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:04,540] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 18 | Text: 一旦你在别人面前变得透明灾难也就降临了
Segment #3   [00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:05,300] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 这不是冷漠
Segment #4   [00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,180] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 17 | Text: 而是一个人在社会上必须要懂得保命法则
Segment #5   [00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:11,440] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 20 | Text: 今天这期视频我们就来聊一聊三条保命的顶级法则
Segment #6   [00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,780] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 14 | Text: 看懂了你能避开90%的烂人烂事
Segment #7   [00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,520] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 7  | Text: 建议先点赞收藏
Segment #8   [00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:16,720] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 第一条学会闭嘴
Segment #9   [00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,140] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 9  | Text: 不要任何人看透你的底牌
Segment #10  [00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,260] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 大多数人都有个通病
Segment #11  [00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,020] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 9  | Text: 稍微遇到个对自己好的人
Segment #12  [00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,100] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 就恨不得掏心掏肺
Segment #13  [00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:22,980] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 5  | Text: 真正聪明的人
Segment #14  [00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:25,300] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 14 | Text: 为人处设的第一条原则就是把嘴闭上
Segment #15  [00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,040] | Elapsed:  16.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 我们要明白一个人性真相
Segment #16  [00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,380] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个世界上除了你自己
Segment #17  [00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:30,680] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 14 | Text: 没有任何人会真正希望你过得比他好
Segment #18  [00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:32,520] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 10 | Text: 你越是频繁的暴露隐私
Segment #19  [00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,620] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 你的软肋也就越多
Segment #20  [00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:35,820] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 15 | Text: 相当于亲手把刀子低倒别人的手上
Segment #21  [00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:37,320] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 你今天顺嘴抱怨的话
Segment #22  [00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:39,500] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 13 | Text: 明天可能就成了别人拿捏你的把柄
Segment #23  [00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,640] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 12 | Text: 保持距离才是最聪明的做法
Segment #24  [00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,100] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 这不是什么心机全谋
Segment #25  [00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:45,500] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 12 | Text: 而是成年人最基本的自我保护
Segment #26  [00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,500] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 17 | Text: 所以说学会闭嘴就是成年人必须要懂得功课
Segment #27  [00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,600] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 5  | Text: 保持距离感
Segment #28  [00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,120] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 9  | Text: 让别人摸不清你的底细
Segment #29  [00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:53,180] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 15 | Text: 别人自然而然就不敢轻易欺负你了
Segment #30  [00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:53,940] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 2  | Text: 第二条
Segment #31  [00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:56,580] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 15 | Text: 不要让任何人无常从你这儿拿走东西
Segment #32  [00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:58,260] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 以前我总觉得帮助别人
Segment #33  [00:00:58,260 --> 00:00:59,680] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是在积攒自己的人脉
Segment #34  [00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:02,220] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 15 | Text: 后来发现你越是无底线的无常付出
Segment #35  [00:01:02,220 --> 00:01:03,500] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 9  | Text: 别人越不把你当回事
Segment #36  [00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,000] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 14 | Text: 人与人的关系本质是价值的流动
Segment #37  [00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,340] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 讲究的是阴阳平衡
Segment #38  [00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:10,340] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 17 | Text: 任何关系里的能量都必须是有来有往的
Segment #39  [00:01:10,340 --> 00:01:12,620] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 14 | Text: 单方面的付出只会被当成一个烂好人
Segment #40  [00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:14,740] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 12 | Text: 得到的结果就是无底线的索取
Segment #41  [00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:16,520] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 所以说收起你的善良
Segment #42  [00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:19,740] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 19 | Text: 不要让任何人从你这里毫无代价的拿走任何东西
Segment #43  [00:01:19,740 --> 00:01:21,300] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 10 | Text: 哪怕是一句专业的建议
Segment #44  [00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:22,520] | Elapsed:  54.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 一个微不足道的帮助
Segment #45  [00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,600] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 4  | Text: 我们要记住
Segment #46  [00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:26,500] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 18 | Text: 人与人之间最稳固的关系永远是等价交换
Segment #47  [00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:27,360] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 5  | Text: 免费的午餐
Segment #48  [00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:28,700] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 最后只会坑害了自己
Segment #49  [00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:29,360] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 2  | Text: 第三条
Segment #50  [00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:30,400] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 5  | Text: 不要做一个舔狗
Segment #51  [00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:32,220] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 关系从来不是舔出来的
Segment #52  [00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:34,000] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 而是双方的利益是否匹配
Segment #53  [00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,060] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 4  | Text: 自己不强大
Segment #54  [00:01:35,060 --> 00:01:35,940] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 5  | Text: 靠谁都没用
Segment #55  [00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:37,600] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 有钱人不是傻子
Segment #56  [00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:38,640] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 贵人也不是白痴
Segment #57  [00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,780] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 没有任何人会去做
Segment #58  [00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:40,800] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 没有回报的付出
Segment #59  [00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:42,260] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 当你自己强大了
Segment #60  [00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:44,600] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 13 | Text: 你的能量常自然会吸引到同频的人
Segment #61  [00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,660] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 价值才是社会运行的规律
Segment #62  [00:01:46,660 --> 00:01:49,000] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 10 | Text: 没有价值的社交全都是扯淡
Segment #63  [00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,460] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 有价值才有社交
Segment #64  [00:01:50,460 --> 00:01:51,460] | Elapsed:  73.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 有利益才有帮助
Segment #65  [00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:52,760] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 8  | Text: 没有无缘无物的付出
Segment #66  [00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:54,020] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 9  | Text: 也没有无缘无物的帮助
Segment #67  [00:01:54,020 --> 00:01:55,440] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 9  | Text: 一切的东西都是对等的
Segment #68  [00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:56,220] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 2  | Text: 所以说
Segment #69  [00:01:56,220 --> 00:01:58,340] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 10 | Text: 没有自己强大才是强者之道
Segment #70  [00:01:58,340 --> 00:01:59,940] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 8  | Text: 最后再送大家一句话
Segment #71  [00:01:59,940 --> 00:02:01,780] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 8  | Text: 宁要人骂 莫要人怜
Segment #72  [00:02:01,780 --> 00:02:04,200] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 13 | Text: 宁愿做一个背负了所有骂名的坏人
Segment #73  [00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:06,640] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 15 | Text: 也不要做一个在深夜里抱头痛苦的好人
Segment #74  [00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,260] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 9  | Text: 你骂我说明你记住我
Segment #75  [00:02:08,260 --> 00:02:09,080] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油陌生人
Segment #76  [00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:09,980] | Elapsed:  87.42s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你越来越好
